{
    "_doc": "DARK-mode panel tab plate (tracker \u00a74.16 C2). Pairs with TabPlateLight; ChromePalette picks between them and supplies the matching label/icon colors. A graphite machined tab that reads as a milled edge of the rack unit rather than a software tab: dark face, a lit top bevel catching the key light, a dark rim below it, and a vertical gradient so it has a direction. Deliberately LOW contrast against the panel it belongs to and HIGH contrast against its own label \u2014 the label is the thing that has to be readable.",
